@host = http://localhost:10406

### 가상데이터 생성 Flow 생성
POST {{host}}/api/rule-engine/organizations/2/storages/1/sections/22/virtual-sensor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": {
    "min": 25,
    "max": 26
  },
  "humidity": {
    "min": 50,
    "max": 55
  },

  "illumination": {
    "min": 100,
    "max": 150
  },

  "doorOpenProbability": 0.01,
  "measurementIntervalSeconds": 60,
  "deviceEui": "device-eui-virtual-22"
}

### Section에서 Flow 정지
PATCH {{host}}/api/rule-engine/organizations/2/storages/1/sections/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### Section에서 Flow 다시시작
PATCH {{host}}/api/rule-engine/organizations/2/storages/1/sections/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}